Native engine app (experiments/native-engine/frontend): pages a host adds to the in-game menu (the melee-unlocked
options, the feature modules), greyed rows, hidden rows, another label for a row, the Quit action, a HUD extra and the
console row layout off the console (MU_MENU_CONSOLE, for the Linux test build). Applied to a build-time copy only.
